#: scenario7:scenario7_2917C442_2C2F_4A42_8209_D81D50F57791
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22973d02644e3f98eb92f2f025b671f8ffda76a615ffdf33e39818606e6b47f2
