#: scenario7:scenario7_A27261B4_309E_4583_92FE_6917A44D1D9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e238333f38e0db9eea0c373e5c55b6e9e5b31281a6c8b06dcc7e3d99c12a127a
